rix whose rows are given by $a,$ $b,$ and $c.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|-3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|+2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(4\\cdot 1-0\\cdot 1)-3(3\\cdot 1-2\\cdot 1)+2(3\\cdot 0-2\\cdot 4) \\\\  & =4-3-16 \\\\  & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-20050/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff317cd2-0896-5134-b3a3-4e9f84e22b68"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20050"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317319/field-1/61c0d3f6231bee44025903589d73a9f80ff3cc2b54077f94b4b93c72b3bfa60e" :answer/id #uuid "d9ea412a-ac59-54dc-a0f3-117c08a84eb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-61" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317319/field-1/0c91aee12841e83df8a63bea4f335135e4f592b0fef26da9fddc6b9cb7ae4e6d" :answer/id #uuid "343e78a7-96a6-5858-bb16-a9baff5872dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "61" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317319/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "219e93a6-8a1d-5bd2-8a85-573a14d9975d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317319/field-1/61c0d3f6231bee44025903589d73a9f80ff3cc2b54077f94b4b93c72b3bfa60e" :answer-field/choices ["q-317319/field-1/61c0d3f6231bee44025903589d73a9f80ff3cc2b54077f94b4b93c72b3bfa60e" "q-317319/field-1/0c91aee12841e83df8a63bea4f335135e4f592b0fef26da9fddc6b9cb7ae4e6d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317319" :question/id #uuid "57d195f2-409b-5b85-9dc0-07acb5129669" :question/math-academy-id "q-317319" :question/problem "Let $a=⟨2,1,3⟩$, $b=⟨1,4,0⟩$ and $c=⟨6,-1,2⟩.$ Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ using a determinant.\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the scalar triple product $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ is just the determinant of the matrix whose rows are given by $a,$ $b,$ and $c.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|\\,-\\,1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{aligned}|\\,+\\,3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\,(4\\cdot 2-0\\cdot (-1))\\,-\\,1\\,(1\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 6)\\,+\\,3\\,(1\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 6) \\\\  & =2\\,(8)\\,-\\,1\\,(2)\\,+\\,3\\,(-25) \\\\  & =16-2-75 \\\\  & =-61.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317319/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff317cd2-0896-5134-b3a3-4e9f84e22b68"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317319"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317317/field-1/879a225aaf1b8272157c33247ace982b7e338d5701ba0d4d6c31dd38d4da6784" :answer/id #uuid "e1ed1115-a6c4-56a4-bdd3-321959029acf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "56" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317317/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c1769f0-f697-5810-af19-6cb2fc87c80d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317317/field-1/879a225aaf1b8272157c33247ace982b7e338d5701ba0d4d6c31dd38d4da6784" :answer-field/choices ["q-317317/field-1/879a225aaf1b8272157c33247ace982b7e338d5701ba0d4d6c31dd38d4da6784"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317317" :question/id #uuid "192e5009-8f66-524e-8d13-2212ca08e2eb" :question/math-academy-id "q-317317" :question/problem "Let $a=⟨1,2,3⟩$, $b=⟨4,0,-2⟩$ and $c=⟨5,6,1⟩.$ Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ using a determinant.\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the scalar triple product $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ is just the determinant of the matrix whose rows are given by $a,$ $b,$ and $c.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}|\\,-\\,2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}|\\,+\\,3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\,(0\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot 6)\\,-\\,2\\,(4\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot 5)\\,+\\,3\\,(4\\cdot 6-0\\cdot 5) \\\\  & =1\\,(12)\\,-\\,2\\,(14)\\,+\\,3\\,(24) \\\\  & =12-28+72 \\\\  & =56.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317317/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff317cd2-0896-5134-b3a3-4e9f84e22b68"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317317"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317320/field-1/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer/id #uuid "80757b26-c636-5750-8f74-753e22c144e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186304253 :answer-field/choices ["q-317320/field-1/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347/selection/94b1e608a1bece13c117321c62644f2051416b0003719c2dd4b9ea44af9d6b64" :answer/id #uuid "83ee1e28-3663-5964-be84-3da65f02e2e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-28" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347/selection/ebfc0e0786b9e08f32fe2539ae50e791a60b7c4613bb2a0820cefbd3ea742454" :answer/id #uuid "7929220b-ecbf-5865-8f07-c382248e9103" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-60" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347/selection/5d34995cddd0166b343cae457ee45643c04c739e08758db1204c66c5ee04158e" :answer/id #uuid "b0cb846b-dd4b-5919-8673-dfb4b693d399" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "4f9a0d3d-a344-5650-a35c-669ce3abe6b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "34e5d4e2-f3bd-5976-808f-b3b817d0f2af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a2ca15b-e28e-511b-9ea3-53f0905a2721" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128347/selection/94b1e608a1bece13c117321c62644f2051416b0003719c2dd4b9ea44af9d6b64" :answer-field/choices ["q-128347/selection/94b1e608a1bece13c117321c62644f2051416b0003719c2dd4b9ea44af9d6b64" "q-128347/selection/ebfc0e0786b9e08f32fe2539ae50e791a60b7c4613bb2a0820cefbd3ea742454" "q-128347/selection/5d34995cddd0166b343cae457ee45643c04c739e08758db1204c66c5ee04158e" "q-128347/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-128347/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128347" :question/id #uuid "e91f9522-ea1f-56c1-860c-f828215fa23d" :question/math-academy-id "q-128347" :question/problem "Let $p=⟨7,4,9⟩,$ $q=⟨1,2,-2⟩$ and $r=⟨3,0,5⟩.$ Find $q\\cdot (r\\times p).$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the scalar triple product $q\\cdot (r\\times p)$ is just the determinant of the matrix whose rows are given by $q,$ $r,$ and $p.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}q\\cdot (r\\times p) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 4 & 9\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 9\\end{aligned}|-2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 9\\end{aligned}|+(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 9-4\\cdot 5)-2(3\\cdot 9-7\\cdot 5)-2(3\\cdot 4-7\\cdot 0) \\\\  & =-20+16-24 \\\\  & =-28.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128347/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff317cd2-0896-5134-b3a3-4e9f84e22b68"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128347"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352/selection/5ab3573096b30d3c5d3c378e667364cbb062f921e9b1002441e594f0774a669d" :answer/id #uuid "1a5f5ed7-00f0-5a58-b323-53a0c4747865" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "a0230f34-e505-50e0-89af-e4c66eed4fa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "577a7cf6-7241-5e85-957d-f553fe7bab7a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "2a7ce25e-f24a-519b-b1bb-d8a17c60d21a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "7fb3313f-f8d2-526e-851f-b9b3e2fe73c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c1bfe344-08ca-55a1-8b7a-55afdd906ddc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128352/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer-field/choices ["q-128352/selection/5ab3573096b30d3c5d3c378e667364cbb062f921e9b1002441e594f0774a669d" "q-128352/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-128352/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" "q-128352/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" "q-128352/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128352" :question/id #uuid "f8a439b3-4c92-5c3c-9684-a208933c8994" :question/math-academy-id "q-128352" :question/problem "Find $c\\cdot (a\\times b),$ if $a\\cdot ((-3b)\\times (-7c))=7.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor out the constants and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot ((-3b)\\times (-7c)) & =7 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot (-7)\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =7 \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c\\cdot (b\\times a) & =-\\frac{1}{3},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c\\cdot (a\\times b) & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128352/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e0b4d33-7699-5068-90f1-663534cd662d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128352"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-20057/selection/3224ab5f6f5fb64621a714f7654c4df06661a69e7edb8f5993dcef1e46ce3dea" :answer/id #uuid "95bdd564-5852-571f-a336-ee429eb3aa63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20057/selection/80f9bea33aa6a89d127ee9002c35787893c3c59b57df469ba089cea1a4a6a472" :answer/id #uuid "416f30c9-011b-59f1-8040-bfda6da11b9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20057/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer/id #uuid "da2e7952-3ee9-5e6f-b80b-46050f955d0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20057/selection/9ab64b945e95c1c3798cea70f4ae7ad55133b01b9b894848